{
 "cells": [
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# 01 - Exploratory Data Analysis\n","\n","## Objective\n","Explore the Club Piscine franchise sales data to understand structure, coverage, and quality.\n","\n","## Data Sources (SharePoint Extracts)\n","| File | Description | Rows |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| `Exemple_Table_Vente.xlsx` | Sales transactions | 139,133 |\n","| `Exemple_Table_Inventaire.xlsx` | Inventory snapshot (Sept 9, 2025 only) | 18,958 |\n","| `Table_Magasins.xlsx` | Store master: codes, cities, franchise groups | 49 |\n","| `Exemple_Table_ITEM_TOTAL.xlsx` | Product catalogue: Division → Catégorie → Groupe | 133,864 |\n","| `Table_Calendrier.xlsx` | Fiscal calendar (Nov 2023 → Oct 2026, daily) | 1,096 |\n","\n","## Key Schema\n","| Column | Table | Role |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| `Date de Vente` | Vente | Sale date (preferred over `Date de la facture`) |\n","| `Montant de la ligne` | Vente | Line amount CAD — **target variable** |\n","| `Division Code` | Vente | Product division (PC, AP, PI, ME, BQ, SP…) |\n","| `No. d'article` | Vente | Item code — joins to `No. Article` in ITEM_TOTAL |\n","| `No. magasin` | Vente | Store code — joins to `Table_Magasins` |\n","| `No. Article` | ITEM_TOTAL | Item code (100% match with Vente) |\n","| `Catégorie` | ITEM_TOTAL | Sub-category within Division (177 values) |\n","| `Groupe de produit` | ITEM_TOTAL | Product group within Catégorie (435 values) |\n","| `Répliqué-Franchisé` | ITEM_TOTAL | 1 = shared catalogue item, 0 = local purchase |\n","| `Fin de semaine` | Calendrier | Week-end date — **join key for Power BI** |\n","| `FiscalYear/Quarter/Month` | Calendrier | Fiscal labels for Power BI semantic model |\n","| `_Semaine fiscale NEW` | Calendrier | Club Piscine fiscal week number |\n","\n","## Outputs\n","- `data/processed/weekly_sales.csv` — Weekly × Store × Division × Catégorie\n","- `data/processed/store_region_map.csv` — Store → city mapping\n","- `data/processed/item_category_map.csv` — Article → Division/Catégorie/Groupe lookup\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 1: Imports and Setup\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","from pathlib import Path\n","import warnings\n","warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n","\n","pd.set_option('display.max_rows', None)\n","pd.set_option('display.max_columns', None)\n","pd.set_option('display.width', None)\n","\n","plt.style.use('seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid')\n","plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 6)\n","plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 10\n","sns.set_palette('husl')\n","\n","PROJECT_ROOT    = Path('..')\n","DATA_RAW        = PROJECT_ROOT / 'data' / 'raw'\n","DATA_PROCESSED  = PROJECT_ROOT / 'data' / 'processed'\n","FIGURES         = PROJECT_ROOT / 'reports' / 'figures'\n","DATA_PROCESSED.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","FIGURES.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","\n","print('✅ Imports complete')"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 2: Load Raw Data\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["vente      = pd.read_excel(DATA_RAW / 'Exemple_Table_Vente.xlsx')\n","magasins   = pd.read_excel(DATA_RAW / 'Table_Magasins.xlsx')\n","inventaire = pd.read_excel(DATA_RAW / 'Exemple_Table_Inventaire.xlsx')\n","items      = pd.read_excel(DATA_RAW / 'Exemple_Table_ITEM_TOTAL.xlsx')\n","calendrier = pd.read_excel(DATA_RAW / 'Table_Calendrier.xlsx')\n","\n","vente['Date de Vente']  = pd.to_datetime(vente['Date de Vente'])\n","inventaire['Date']      = pd.to_datetime(inventaire['Date'])\n","calendrier['Fin de semaine'] = pd.to_datetime(calendrier['Fin de semaine'])\n","\n","print(f'Table Vente      : {vente.shape[0]:,} rows × {vente.shape[1]} cols')\n","print(f'Table Magasins   : {magasins.shape[0]:,} rows × {magasins.shape[1]} cols')\n","print(f'Table Inventaire : {inventaire.shape[0]:,} rows × {inventaire.shape[1]} cols')\n","print(f'ITEM_TOTAL       : {items.shape[0]:,} rows × {items.shape[1]} cols')\n","print(f'Table Calendrier : {calendrier.shape[0]:,} rows (daily, {calendrier[\"Fin de semaine\"].nunique()} unique weeks)')\n","print(f'\\nVente date range : {vente[\"Date de Vente\"].min().date()} → {vente[\"Date de Vente\"].max().date()}')"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 3: Store List & Region Mapping\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["store_map = magasins[['Codes magasins','Ville magasins','Regroupement','Nom Regroupement']].copy()\n","store_map.columns = ['store_code','city','franchise_group','franchise_name']\n","\n","active_stores    = vente['No. magasin'].unique()\n","store_map_active = store_map[store_map['store_code'].isin(active_stores)].copy()\n","\n","print('='*60)\n","print('ACTIVE STORES IN SALES EXTRACT')\n","print('='*60)\n","print(f'Stores: {sorted(active_stores)}')\n","print()\n","print(store_map_active.to_string(index=False))\n","\n","store_map_active.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'store_region_map.csv', index=False)\n","print('\\n✅ Saved: store_region_map.csv')\n","\n","print('\\n' + '='*60)\n","print('FULL NETWORK — Table_Magasins (all 49 entries)')\n","print('='*60)\n","print(magasins[['Codes magasins','Ville magasins','Nom Regroupement']].to_string(index=False))"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 4: Product Catalogue Enrichment (ITEM_TOTAL)\n","\n","**Join key:** `Vente['No. d'article']` ↔ `ITEM_TOTAL['No. Article']`\n","**Join rate: 100%** — every article in the sales extract exists in the catalogue.\n","\n","This adds:\n","- `Catégorie` — finer grain than Division (177 unique values vs 26 divisions)\n","- `Groupe de produit` — finest grain (435 groups), for future SKU-level forecasting\n","- `Répliqué-Franchisé` — flag to distinguish shared catalogue (1) from local purchases (0)\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# Build item lookup (keep only CPSS shared catalogue rows where possible)\n","item_lookup = (\n","    items[['No. Article','Division','Catégorie','Groupe de produit','Répliqué-Franchisé']]\n","    .drop_duplicates(subset='No. Article')\n","    .copy()\n",")\n","item_lookup['No. Article'] = item_lookup['No. Article'].astype(str)\n","\n","# Join onto Vente\n","vente[\"No. d'article\"] = vente[\"No. d'article\"].astype(str)\n","vente = vente.merge(\n","    item_lookup,\n","    left_on=\"No. d'article\",\n","    right_on='No. Article',\n","    how='left'\n").drop(columns='No. Article')\n","\n","join_rate = vente['Catégorie'].notna().sum() / len(vente) * 100\n","print(f'Join rate (Catégorie filled): {join_rate:.1f}%')\n","print(f'Unique Catégories in sales  : {vente[\"Catégorie\"].nunique()}')\n","print(f'Unique Groupes in sales     : {vente[\"Groupe de produit\"].nunique()}')\n","\n","# Save item lookup table for downstream use\n","item_lookup.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'item_category_map.csv', index=False)\n","print('✅ Saved: item_category_map.csv')"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# Sales breakdown by Catégorie\n","print('='*60)\n","print('TOP CATEGORIES BY REVENUE (Catégorie)')\n","print('='*60)\n","cat_summary = (\n","    vente.groupby(['Division Code','Catégorie'])\n","         .agg(total_sales=('Montant de la ligne','sum'),\n","              transactions=('Montant de la ligne','count'))\n","         .sort_values('total_sales', ascending=False)\n","         .reset_index()\n",")\n","cat_summary['pct'] = (cat_summary['total_sales'] / cat_summary['total_sales'].sum() * 100).round(1)\n","print(cat_summary.head(20).to_string(index=False))\n","\n","fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 6))\n","top15 = cat_summary.head(15)\n","ax.barh(top15['Catégorie'] + ' (' + top15['Division Code'] + ')',\n","        top15['total_sales'] / 1e6, color='steelblue')\n","ax.set_xlabel('Total Sales ($M)')\n","ax.set_title('Top 15 Catégories by Revenue')\n","ax.invert_yaxis()\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig(FIGURES / 'category_breakdown.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","print('✅ Saved: category_breakdown.png')"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# Répliqué-Franchisé breakdown — shared vs local\n","print('='*60)\n","print('SHARED CATALOGUE vs LOCAL PURCHASES')\n","print('='*60)\n","rep_summary = (\n","    vente.groupby('Répliqué-Franchisé')['Montant de la ligne']\n","         .agg(['sum','count'])\n","         .rename(columns={'sum':'total_sales','count':'transactions'})\n",")\n","rep_summary['pct_sales'] = (rep_summary['total_sales'] / rep_summary['total_sales'].sum() * 100).round(1)\n","rep_summary.index = rep_summary.index.map({1.0:'Shared catalogue (1)', 0.0:'Local purchase (0)'})\n","print(rep_summary.to_string())\n","print('\\nNote: Forecasting model focuses on shared catalogue items (Répliqué-Franchisé = 1).')"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 5: Table_Calendrier — Fiscal Week Structure\n","\n","Michèle's Power BI semantic model uses `Fin de semaine` as the date key for all weekly data.\n","All forecast outputs must join on this column — confirmed 100% alignment with our `week_ending`.\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["print('='*60)\n","print('TABLE_CALENDRIER STRUCTURE')\n","print('='*60)\n","print(f'Coverage : {calendrier[\"Date\"].min().date()} → {calendrier[\"Date\"].max().date()}')\n","print(f'Daily rows: {len(calendrier):,}  |  Unique weeks: {calendrier[\"Fin de semaine\"].nunique()}')\n","print(f'Fiscal years: {sorted(calendrier[\"FiscalYear\"].unique())}')\n","\n","# Verify our week_ending dates align perfectly with Fin de semaine\n","vente['week_ending'] = vente['Date de Vente'] + pd.offsets.Week(weekday=6)\n","our_weeks = set(vente['week_ending'].dt.normalize().unique())\n","cal_weeks = set(calendrier['Fin de semaine'].dt.normalize().unique())\n","missing   = our_weeks - cal_weeks\n","\n","print(f'\\nOur week_ending dates         : {len(our_weeks)}')\n","print(f'Calendar Fin de semaine dates : {len(cal_weeks)}')\n","print(f'Alignment check               : {\"✅ 100% match\" if not missing else f\"⚠️  {len(missing)} weeks not in calendar\"}')\n","\n","# Show the useful columns for Power BI enrichment\n","CAL_JOIN_COLS = [\n","    'Fin de semaine', 'FiscalYear', 'FiscalQuarter', 'FiscalMonthNum',\n","    'FiscalMonth', '_Semaine fiscale NEW', 'CurWeekOffset', 'FutureDate'\n","]\n","cal_weekly = (\n","    calendrier[CAL_JOIN_COLS]\n","    .drop_duplicates(subset='Fin de semaine')\n","    .sort_values('Fin de semaine')\n","    .reset_index(drop=True)\n",")\n","print(f'\\nCalendar weekly lookup: {cal_weekly.shape}')\n","print(cal_weekly.head(10).to_string(index=False))\n","\n","# Save calendar weekly lookup for downstream notebooks\n","cal_weekly.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'calendar_weekly.csv', index=False)\n","print('\\n✅ Saved: calendar_weekly.csv')"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 6: Division Code Breakdown\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["print('='*60)\n","print('DIVISION CODES — SALES BREAKDOWN')\n","print('='*60)\n","div_summary = (\n","    vente.groupby('Division Code')\n","         .agg(transactions=('Montant de la ligne','count'),\n","              total_sales=('Montant de la ligne','sum'),\n","              avg_line=('Montant de la ligne','mean'),\n","              total_units=('Quantité facturée','sum'))\n","         .sort_values('total_sales', ascending=False)\n","         .reset_index()\n",")\n","div_summary['pct_sales'] = (div_summary['total_sales'] / div_summary['total_sales'].sum() * 100).round(1)\n","print(div_summary.to_string(index=False))"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 7: Data Coverage\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["print('='*60)\n","print('DATA COVERAGE')\n","print('='*60)\n","print(f'Overall: {vente[\"Date de Vente\"].min().date()} → {vente[\"Date de Vente\"].max().date()}')\n","print(f'Weeks  : {vente[\"week_ending\"].nunique()} ({(vente[\"Date de Vente\"].max()-vente[\"Date de Vente\"].min()).days//7} weeks total)')\n","print(f'\\n⚠️  Only peak-season data (June–Sept 2025). Full year needed for production model.')\n","\n","# Enrich with city\n","vente = vente.merge(\n","    store_map_active[['store_code','city','franchise_name']],\n","    left_on='No. magasin', right_on='store_code', how='left'\n").drop(columns='store_code')\n","\n","vente['month']      = vente['Date de Vente'].dt.month\n","vente['week_of_yr'] = vente['Date de Vente'].dt.isocalendar().week.astype(int)\n","\n","store_cov = (\n","    vente.groupby(['No. magasin','city'])\n","         .agg(min_date=('Date de Vente','min'),max_date=('Date de Vente','max'),\n","              n_records=('Montant de la ligne','count'),total_sales=('Montant de la ligne','sum'))\n","         .reset_index()\n",")\n","store_cov['weeks'] = ((store_cov['max_date']-store_cov['min_date']).dt.days/7).round(1)\n","print('\\nCoverage by store:')\n","print(store_cov.to_string(index=False))"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 8: Inventory Data Audit\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["print('='*60)\n","print('INVENTORY DATA AUDIT')\n","print('='*60)\n","print(f'Snapshot date   : {inventaire[\"Date\"].unique()[0].date()}')\n","print(f'⚠️  Single snapshot — NOT a time series')\n","print(f'Unique items    : {inventaire[\"Item No_\"].nunique():,}')\n","print(f'Locations       : {sorted(inventaire[\"Location Code\"].unique())}')\n","\n","inv_by_loc = (\n","    inventaire.groupby('Location Code')\n","              .agg(n_items=('Item No_','nunique'),\n","                   qty_available=('Quantity Available','sum'),\n","                   inventory_value=('Inventory Value','sum'))\n","              .sort_values('inventory_value', ascending=False)\n",")\n","print('\\nInventory by location:')\n","print(inv_by_loc.to_string())\n","print(\"\"\"\n","─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","MODELING IMPLICATION:\n","  Single snapshot → cannot be used as time-varying feature.\n","  Used downstream (notebook 04) for inventory gap analysis:\n","  Forecast demand vs current stock → flag potential gaps in Power BI.\n","  → Request weekly snapshots for future versions.\n","─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","\"\"\")"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 9: Sales Visualizations\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(16, 10))\n","\n","ax1 = axes[0, 0]\n","daily = vente.groupby('Date de Vente')['Montant de la ligne'].sum()\n","ax1.plot(daily.index, daily.values, color='steelblue', linewidth=1)\n","ax1.set_title('Total Daily Sales (All Stores)')\n","ax1.set_ylabel('Sales ($)')\n","ax1.yaxis.set_major_formatter(plt.FuncFormatter(lambda x, p: f'${x:,.0f}'))\n","\n","ax2 = axes[0, 1]\n","weekly_city = vente.groupby(['week_ending','city'])['Montant de la ligne'].sum().reset_index()\n","for city in weekly_city['city'].dropna().unique():\n","    d = weekly_city[weekly_city['city']==city]\n","    ax2.plot(d['week_ending'], d['Montant de la ligne'], marker='o', label=city, linewidth=1.5)\n","ax2.set_title('Weekly Sales by City')\n","ax2.set_ylabel('Weekly Sales ($)')\n","ax2.legend(fontsize=8)\n","ax2.yaxis.set_major_formatter(plt.FuncFormatter(lambda x, p: f'${x:,.0f}'))\n","\n","ax3 = axes[1, 0]\n","top_div = vente.groupby('Division Code')['Montant de la ligne'].sum().sort_values(ascending=True).tail(10)\n","top_div.plot(kind='barh', ax=ax3, color='coral')\n","ax3.set_xlabel('Total Sales ($)')\n","ax3.set_title('Sales by Division Code (Top 10)')\n","ax3.xaxis.set_major_formatter(plt.FuncFormatter(lambda x, p: f'${x/1e6:.1f}M'))\n","\n","ax4 = axes[1, 1]\n","store_sales = vente.groupby('city')['Montant de la ligne'].sum()\n","ax4.pie(store_sales.values, labels=store_sales.index, autopct='%1.1f%%', startangle=90)\n","ax4.set_title('Sales Share by City')\n","\n","plt.suptitle('Club Piscine Franchise — Sales EDA', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig(FIGURES / 'sales_eda_overview.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","print('✅ Saved: sales_eda_overview.png')"]},
  {"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","## Cell 10: Weekly Aggregation for Modeling\n","\n","Granularity: **Week × Store × Division Code × Catégorie**\n","The `Catégorie` column enables finer-grain forecasting if needed.\n","Primary modeling target remains Division Code level for the prototype.\n","---"]},
  {"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["# Aggregate at Division level (primary modeling grain)\n","weekly = (\n","    vente.groupby(['week_ending','No. magasin','city','Division Code'])\n","         .agg(sales=('Montant de la ligne','sum'),\n","              units=('Quantité facturée','sum'),\n","              n_transactions=('Montant de la ligne','count'))\n","         .reset_index()\n","         .rename(columns={'No. magasin':'store_code','Division Code':'division_code'})\n",")\n","weekly['sales'] = weekly['sales'].clip(lower=0)\n","\n","# Also aggregate at Catégorie level (saved separately for future use)\n","weekly_cat = (\n","    vente.groupby(['week_ending','No. magasin','city','Division Code','Catégorie'])\n","         .agg(sales=('Montant de la ligne','sum'),\n","              units=('Quantité facturée','sum'))\n","         .reset_index()\n","         .rename(columns={'No. magasin':'store_code','Division Code':'division_code',\n","                           'Catégorie':'categorie'})\n",")\n","weekly_cat['sales'] = weekly_cat['sales'].clip(lower=0)\n","\n","print(f'Weekly (Division level) : {len(weekly):,} rows')\n","print(f'Weekly (Catégorie level): {len(weekly_cat):,} rows')\n","print(f'Weeks  : {weekly[\"week_ending\"].nunique()}')\n","print(f'Stores : {weekly[\"store_code\"].nunique()}')\n","print(f'Divs   : {weekly[\"division_code\"].nunique()}')\n","\n","MIN_WEEKS = 10\n","g = weekly.groupby(['store_code','division_code'])['week_ending'].count().reset_index(name='n_weeks')\n","print(f'\\nGroups with ≥ {MIN_WEEKS} weeks: {(g.n_weeks >= MIN_WEEKS).sum()} / {len(g)}')\n","print(g[g.n_weeks >= MIN_WEEKS].sort_values('n_weeks', ascending=False).to_string(index=False))\n","\n","weekly.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'weekly_sales.csv', index=False)\n","weekly_cat.to_csv(DATA_PROCESSED / 'weekly_sales_category.csv', index=False)\n","print(f'\\n✅ Saved: weekly_sales.csv ({len(weekly):,} rows)')\n","print(f'✅ Saved: weekly_sales_category.csv ({len(weekly_cat):,} rows)')\n","print(f'✅ Saved: store_region_map.csv')\n","print(f'✅ Saved: item_category_map.csv')\n","print(f'✅ Saved: calendar_weekly.csv')\n","print('\\nNext → 02_weather_integration.ipynb')"]}
 ],
